# GitHub Linguist Language Configuration
# Only Python, JavaScript, HTML, CSS are recognized as codebase languages

*.py linguist-language=Python
*.js linguist-language=JavaScript
*.jsx linguist-language=JavaScript
*.html linguist-language=HTML
*.css linguist-language=CSS

# Exclude auxiliary configuration, shell scripts, and build artifacts from language statistics
*.sh linguist-vendored
*.yaml linguist-vendored
*.yml linguist-vendored
*.json linguist-vendored
*.txt linguist-vendored
*.md linguist-documentation
Dockerfile linguist-vendored
frontend/dist/** linguist-vendored
